This project is a graphical front-end built on top of the serial protocol
and command framing that was reverse-engineered by Prehistoricman and
documented in the Xbox_SMC project:

    https://github.com/Prehistoricman/Xbox_SMC

The Xyclops protocol details used in this tool — command opcodes, address
layout, baud switching, and BIOS/SMC read/write/erase behavior — are
derived from that work. Prehistoricman's original scripts are provided
without a license file; this project credits them here and reproduces the
protocol behavior in good faith.

